objective............                 movie review system help the viewers to select movies on the basis of reviews so they may save their time and money.Here some users(movie experts) may give their valuable suggestion in the of reviews on the scale of 1-10 ,movie experts first have to watch movie , which is listed in a movie table, and then if they want they may review it .we may use this project as a prototype of real project because here we apply all constraints and also manage proper relationship(one to one, one to many )And also try to give proper reply of all possible business problem .by applying Joins ,and also defined some custom functions , trigger and procedure to get fit well in our projectrough contenttablemovie => id , title ,genre,duration,languageuser => user_id , user_name , emailreview => rid , u_id, m_idE-R diagram.entity                 relationship                   entity user               user watch movie                  movie